id=sandboxid
name=SandboxID — Android device identifier privacy research module
version=v2.1.11
versionCode=229
author=Ilham311
description=SandboxID is an open-source Android privacy research and education module for devices you own. Module-local identity is presented through per-target Zygisk, JNI, Bionic, and mount-namespace paths; genuine runtime capabilities and hardware-backed attestation remain unchanged. Device-wide identifier operations are manual and separate. target.txt ships empty, so the module is idle until you add an application.
updateJson=https://github.com/Ilham311/SandboxID/releases/latest/download/update.json
